## Copy to local.properties (do not commit local.properties to git).
##
## Demo mode works WITHOUT a key — just clone, sync, and run.
##
## For real Gemini AI responses:
## 1. Get a free key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
## 2. Uncomment and paste your key below
## 3. Sync Gradle and rebuild

sdk.dir=/path/to/your/Android/sdk

# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy_your_actual_key_here
